<title>BELARUS: Belarussian rouble unchanged at 14,500 to dlr in M.</title>
<headline>Belarussian rouble unchanged at 14,500 to dlr in M.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The belarussian rouble was unchanged at 14,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    August 28	     August 27</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    14,500		  14,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $9.603 million	    $3.731 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
